  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\n**Logic: **(Third number + Second number) × 8 = First number.\n\n**Given:**\n\n(216, 12, 15)\n\n⇒ (15 + 12) × 8\n\n⇒ 27 × 8 = 216\n\nAnd,\n\n(432, 23, 31)\n\n⇒ (23 + 31) × 8\n\n⇒ 54 × 8 = 432\n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n1) (304, 14, 24)\n\n⇒ (14 + 24) × 8\n\n⇒ 38 × 8 = 304 (Correct)\n\n2) (380, 24, 18)\n\n⇒ (24 + 18) × 8\n\n⇒ 42 × 8 = 336 ≠ 380 (Incorrect)\n\n3) (150, 11, 14)\n\n⇒ (11 + 14) × 8\n\n⇒ 25 × 8 = 200 ≠ 150 (Incorrect)\n\n4) (484, 16, 32)\n\n⇒ (16 + 32) × 8\n\n⇒ 48 × 8 = 384 ≠ 484 (Incorrect)\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****(304, 14, 24)\"**",
